config USB_UHCI_HCD
    tristate "UHCI USB HID host controller"
    default y
    help
      Native PCI UHCI and boot HID keyboard/mouse support. M builds uhci.ko.
      All schedule/transfer DMA comes from explicit 32-bit coherent backing;
      permanent USB input dispatch drains callbacks before hardware teardown.
